<title>LATVIA: TWO UP, ONE DOWN AT T-BILL SALE.</title>
<headline>TWO UP, ONE DOWN AT T-BILL SALE.</headline>
<dateline>RIGA 1997-08-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The yields on one and three month</p>
<p>government Treasury bills fell at auction on Wednesday while</p>
<p>the rates for one year paper rose, the finance ministry said.</p>
<p>All amounts are in millions of lats.</p>
<p> MATURITY    AV YLD	 LAST  NO OF BANKS    ISSUE  BID SOLD</p>
<p> One month    3.96	  3.95	 3	    0.5   0.68  0.5</p>
<p> Three-month  4.06	  4.03	 5	    0.7   1.5   0.7</p>
<p> One-year     5.84	  6.42	 11	   12.0  28.98 12</p>
<p>-- Riga Newsroom, +371 721 5240</p>
